{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Backrooms: Lost Dimension</strong> is a <strong>single-player horror adventure</strong>. Explore unsettling levels, solve unique puzzles, and survive terrifying encounters while following an <strong>original story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free content updates with new levels will expand the experience and keep the nightmare evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/22f388d1ecc425b80a17b34924360c12.poster.avif?t=1772505965\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/22f388d1ecc425b80a17b34924360c12.webm?t=1772505965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/22f388d1ecc425b80a17b34924360c12.mp4?t=1772505965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/ac46f70a9a1ef4bbe23f966b1312c634.avif?t=1772505965\" width=1530 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong><br>Explore a dark and captivating world, where every room hides secrets and every corner can surprise you. Get ready for an experience that will keep you engaged from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>10 levels per chapter (over 300 levels in total):</strong><br>Each chapter features 10 unique levels, with increasing challenges and varied environments. The full game will include over 300 levels designed to test your skills and ingenuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve puzzles:</strong><br>Challenge your mind with creative and intricate puzzles that unlock new areas, reveal secrets, and guide your adventure.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience story fragments:</strong><br>\u201cDiscover the story piece by piece through short narrative sequences, allowing the plot to slowly unfold as you explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/4e88d8f1c666f7255664bd974a79fa0e.poster.avif?t=1772505965\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/4e88d8f1c666f7255664bd974a79fa0e.webm?t=1772505965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/4e88d8f1c666f7255664bd974a79fa0e.mp4?t=1772505965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036160/extras/704da338ff58d81a0212dac45de553c1.avif?t=1772505965\" width=1530 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We need your support to make <strong>The Lost Dimension</strong> the ultimate Backrooms experience! Adding the game to your wishlist helps us reach more players and shows the community that you want to see this world fully realized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By wishlist-ing, you\u2019ll be the first to get updates, news, and sneak peeks as we continue developing new levels, puzzles, a